# reel's tour: its code demo and its command line demo, joined into one video. Each scene is its own reel, recorded on
# its own (`mise run demos tour` records both); this one only joins them, with a slide between and reel's stings
# around them.
Import //demos/reel.reelpreset
Include code.reel
Include@slide-left,ease-in-out,800ms cli.reel

Output //docs/media/tour.mp4
Output //docs/media/tour.gif
Intro@crossfade,ease-out,600ms square ? "reel" "Code and the command line" : 2s
Outro@fade,800ms square ? "Recorded with reel" "brew install --cask mpdreamz/tap/reel" : 2s
